Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Site Administration|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Site Administration|
		|globalSiteName|Global|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Page And Child Page Translations
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|SitesUsecase#AddPageAndChildPageTranslations|
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Localization,Site Administration,Site Localization,Site Pages Administration|
	And these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Pages
		|page|Public Pages|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Home|
	And Page add Page Translations
		|page|Home|
		|pageTranslation|es_ES|
		|pageTranslationName|Casa|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page view Translations PG
		|pageLocalizationMessage|This page is displayed in Spanish (Spain). Display the page in English (United States). Set Spanish (Spain) as your preferred language.|
		|pageLocalizationPreferredLanguage|Set Spanish (Spain) as your preferred language.|
		|pageName|Casa|
		|sitePageURL|${portalURL}/es/web/site-name/home|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page localized PG
		|pageLocale|Display the page in English (United States)|
	And Page add Child
		|page|Public Pages|
		|pageName|Home|
		|siteChildPageName|Blog Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|siteScopeSelected|true|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Pages
		|page|Public Pages|
	And Page add Page Translations
		|page|Blog Page|
		|pageTranslation|es_ES|
		|pageTranslationName|Blog Página|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then Page view Translations PG
		|childPageName|Blog Página|
		|pageLocalizationMessage|This page is displayed in Spanish (Spain). Display the page in English (United States). Set Spanish (Spain) as your preferred language.|
		|pageLocalizationPreferredLanguage|Set Spanish (Spain) as your preferred language.|
		|sitePageURL|${portalURL}/es/web/site-name/blog-page|
Scenario: Sites Template Permission Persistence
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|Permissions,Site Administration|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Community CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And PermissionsInline goto Configuration PG
		|portletName|Polls Display|
	And PermissionsInline assert Default PG
		|roleList|Guest,Owner,Power User,Site Member,User|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And PermissionsInline goto Configuration PG
		|portletName|Message Boards|
	And PermissionsInline assert Default PG
		|roleList|Guest,Owner,Power User,Site Member,User|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet view Title
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And SiteTemplates reset Page Changes
		|columnNumberTo|1|
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet view No Specific PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And PermissionsInline goto Configuration PG
		|portletName|Polls Display|
	And PermissionsInline assert Default PG
		|roleList|Guest,Owner,Power User,Site Member,User|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Polls add Poll PG
		|pollsQuestion|What is the most important issue for this election?|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceA|The Economy|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceB|The National Debt|
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Election Poll|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Polls select Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Election Poll|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Polls view Poll PG
		|pollsQuestion|What is the most important issue for this election?|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceList|The Economy,The National Debt|
	And PermissionsInline goto Configuration PG
		|portletName|Message Boards|
	And PermissionsInline assert Default PG
		|roleList|Guest,Owner,Power User,Site Member,User|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And MessageboardsThread add PG
		|threadBody|This is the message boards thread.|
		|threadSubject|Thread|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And MessageboardsThread goto PG
		|lastPostUserName|Test Test|
		|postCount|1|
		|threadBody|This is the message boards thread.|
		|threadSubject|Thread|
	And MessageboardsThread view PG
		|threadBody|This is the message boards thread.|
		|threadSubject|Thread|
	And User logout PG
	And these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And Open at locator '${portalURL}/web/site-name/home'
	And Portlet view Title
		|portletName|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsThread goto PG
		|lastPostUserName|Test Test|
		|postCount|1|
		|threadBody|This is the message boards thread.|
		|threadSubject|Thread|
	And MessageboardsThread view PG
		|threadBody|This is the message boards thread.|
		|threadSubject|Thread|
	And Portlet view Title
		|portletName|Polls Display|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Please sign in to vote.' at locator 'Message#INFO'
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'Search#SEARCH_FIELD'
	And Portlet view Title
		|portletName|User Statistics|
	And SignIn sign In
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userPassword|test|
	And Open at locator '${portalURL}/web/site-name/home'
	And PermissionsInline goto Configuration PG
		|portletName|Polls Display|
	And PermissionsInline add Or Remove View Permission From All Roles
		|addOrRemoveViewPermission|Remove|
		|roleList|Guest,Owner,Power User,Site Member,User|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And PermissionsInline goto Configuration PG
		|portletName|Message Boards|
	And PermissionsInline add Or Remove View Permission From All Roles
		|addOrRemoveViewPermission|Remove|
		|roleList|Guest,Owner,Power User,Site Member,User|
	And User logout PG
	And Open at locator '${portalURL}/web/site-name/home'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'You do not have the roles required to access this portlet.' at locator 'Message#ERROR_1_COLUMN_1'
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'You do not have the roles required to access this portlet.' at locator 'Message#ERROR_1_COLUMN_2'
Scenario: View Default Global Scope Landing Page
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|Site Administration|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Global|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	Then Site view Global Landing Default
		|portletName|Web Content|
		|siteName|Global|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
